  "question": {
    "text": "Let $f(x)=3 \\sqrt{x-2}+\\sqrt{4-x}$ be a real valued function. If $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ are respectively the minimum and the maximum values of $f$, then $\\alpha^2+2 \\beta^2$ is equal to"
  },
